					make {_p} damage loop-entity by {_dmg}
					push loop-entity (vector from {_p} to loop-entity) at speed 0.5 * {_atk-scale}
					push loop-entity up at speed 0.35 * {_atk-scale}
					add loop-entity to {_hit::*}



